id: pm-vcs-sph3
title: Patch series as an object kind
description: "A patch series can be produced from a commit range, transferred, applied and re-derived byte-identically. The series is a native pm-vcs object kind with canonical encoding, not a text convention."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-28T13:43:04.346Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-28T20:11:17.753Z"
