close_reason: "A patch series is a native object kind with a canonical encoding pinned to exact bytes, producible from a commit range, transferable as a bundle, applicable, and re-derivable to a byte-identical id in a fresh store. 100 percent line, branch and function coverage; the encoding test is revert-checked and catches a field-order change that all 27 round-trip tests missed."
